# Timbot source material. These files are the grounding corpus, the recorded
# transcripts, and the evaluation set. They contain employment detail,
# unpublished context, and do-not-say rules that should never be fetchable at
# timlabarge.com/timbot/.
#
# The bot does not read them at runtime. `npm run timbot:build` compiles them
# into api/_lib/knowledge.js, which ships inside the serverless function bundle
# rather than as a static asset, so it is not publicly reachable either.
timbot/

# Build tooling. Run locally, committed for provenance, never served.
scripts/
